    <item>
      <title>Peebles，McNeely筹集了办公室转换的基金</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/peebles-mcneely-to-raise-fund-for-office-to-housing-conversions</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一家由开发商Don Peebles和前Carlyle Group Inc.创立的新投资公司。合伙人道格·麦克尼利（Doug McNeely）寻求筹集多达15亿美元的资金，以将办事处转换为整个美国的住房。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/peebles-mcneely-to-raise-fund-for-office-to-housing-conversions</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
